 Step File Name : blob.step(512 ents)  Write  Done

  ✔ reimports an STL as a closed STEP solid (343ms)
  ✔ honours existing nonuniform model scales without changing the source asset
  ✔ rounds a splayed matrix cavity into closed contours (1253ms)
  ✔ extrudes offset arcs whose chord error is below geometric precision (238ms)
  ✔ extrudes a gasket roof with sub-tolerance offset slivers (269ms)
  ✔ carries solved offsets into a synchronous dependent draft and drops fixed axes
  ✔ carries every emitted model in its exact KiCad frame (62ms)
  ✔ keeps an explicit object model list authoritative (40ms)
  ✔ places framed native imports once without repeating the component side flip
  ✔ retains emitted footprint targets for explicit native models (40ms)
  ✔ checks floating travel against a separately mounted battery
  ✔ locates semantic placement errors in the authored YAML
  ✔ moves mirrored clusters as a group while retaining mirrored member spacing
  ✔ reports a floor-mounted battery that crosses PCB material
  ✔ uses a PCB object as a planar reference without transferring its height to a floor-mounted battery
  ✔ checks PCB travel even where no component body overlaps the battery (59ms)
  ✔ cuts declared corner relief into native plate openings
  ✔ rejects ambiguous physical ownership when two assemblies use the same PCB
  ✔ builds a case with native plate envelopes and no electrical PCB
  ✔ places native polygon regions using their declared envelope offset
  ✔ reports an unmeasured component even when no envelope was supplied
  ✔ exports model associations on imported boards
  ✔ uses flat bridge ends without growing past the attachment points
  ✔ previews keycaps independently of switch bodies and PCB support
  ✔ reports off-board pad areas even when the owning key fits
  ✔ offers a rectangular component bay without boxing unrelated clusters
  ✔ checks custom polygon pad copper beyond its small anchor
  ✔ splays a whole column about its first row
  ✔ derives shared matrix nets while preserving explicit electrical identities
  ✔ applies parametric column offsets to every member
  ✔ solves rotation about a driven origin and resolves named attachments
Sketcher::RedundantSolving-DogLeg-

Sketcher Redundant solving: 1 redundants

  ✔ does not count a repeated alignment against unrelated free movement
  ✔ updates mirrored keys after moving a source cluster
  ✔ uses origin aliases as live frames, not fixed snapshots
Sketcher::RedundantSolving-DogLeg-

Sketcher Redundant solving: 1 redundants

  ✔ keeps a solved source and its referenced mirror linked
  ✔ keeps unaccepted PCB hole proposals after including one hole (346ms)

